## Install

1. Drop `Scripts/{{ s.name }}.cs` into your project's `Assets/`.
2. Add the component to your scene's main Camera.
3. Make sure your follow target GameObject is tagged `{{ s.follow_target_tag }}`.
{% if variant.startswith("cinemachine_") %}
4. Install `com.unity.cinemachine` from Package Manager. Add a `CinemachineCamera` to
   the scene and set its Follow/LookAt to the target tagged `{{ s.follow_target_tag }}`.
{% endif %}

